As you may have noticed, I seem to have also copied in a TODO that I never did. This service is on my list for refactoring as while its implementation is not terrible and really I've never had any problems with it, its a bit messy. As an example, you can see here:
```kotlin
    override suspend fun searchByMemberName(name: String): List<ByteArray> {
        val possiblePlayers = PlayerCache.getIdToName().values.filter { it.lowercase().startsWith(name.lowercase()) }
            .mapNotNull { PlayerCache.getId(it) }
